{"id":"d1d3b024cc821344","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-first-order-clause.md","title":"无等号一阶子句与同时实例","display":"df-first-order-clause — 无等号一阶子句与同时实例","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-first-order-clause","aliases":["72-df-first-order-clause"],"display":"df-first-order-clause — 无等号一阶子句与同时实例","depends_on":["[[72-df-logic-program-syntax]]","[[72-df-logic-program-substitution]]"],"chapter":"I","source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.I §2.6.2 print61/PDF73; explicit local clause syntax","source_kind":"source-based-local-formalization","verification_status":"statement-and-local-argument-reviewed; not-machine-checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"review_2026_10_22_deep":"新增：接口、局部推导与来源边界逐项登记"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-first-order-clause"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-first-order-clause</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-first-order-clause — 无等号一阶子句与同时实例"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"26e8ed17356e430c\" href=\"?note=26e8ed17356e430c\" title=\"72-df-logic-program-syntax\">72-df-logic-program-syntax</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ed15cbe9da0035aa\" href=\"?note=ed15cbe9da0035aa\" title=\"72-df-logic-program-substitution\">72-df-logic-program-substitution</a></span></div>"},{"key":"chapter","html":"I"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.I §2.6.2 print61/PDF73; explicit local clause syntax"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"source-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"statement-and-local-argument-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"review_2026_10_22_deep","html":"新增：接口、局部推导与来源边界逐项登记"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>采用本册 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{PosAt}_\\Sigma,\\mathsf{Lit}_\\Sigma,\\mathsf{Sub}_\\Sigma\">\\(\\mathsf{PosAt}_\\Sigma,\\mathsf{Lit}_\\Sigma,\\mathsf{Sub}_\\Sigma\\)</span>；不含等式原子。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 是正原子，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"l\">\\(l\\)</span> 是文字，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\">\\(C\\)</span> 是有限文字集，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta\\in\\mathsf{Sub}_\\Sigma\">\\(\\theta\\in\\mathsf{Sub}_\\Sigma\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\overline A\">\\(\\overline A\\)</span> 是带负标签的文字。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{FOClause}_\\Sigma:=\\{C\\subseteq\\mathsf{Lit}_\\Sigma:|C|&lt;\\omega\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{FOClause}_\\Sigma:=\\{C\\subseteq\\mathsf{Lit}_\\Sigma:|C|&lt;\\omega\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\overline{\\overline A}:=A,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{atm}(A):=A,\\qquad\\operatorname{atm}(\\overline A):=A.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\overline{\\overline A}:=A,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{atm}(A):=A,\\qquad\\operatorname{atm}(\\overline A):=A.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{vars}_{cl}(C):=\\bigcup_{l\\in C}\\operatorname{vars}(l),\\qquad\nC\\theta:=\\{l\\theta:l\\in C\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{vars}_{cl}(C):=\\bigcup_{l\\in C}\\operatorname{vars}(l),\\qquad\nC\\theta:=\\{l\\theta:l\\in C\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这是集合子句，因此同一代入可以把几个不同文字合成一个文字，空子句允许。代入对每个无绑定文字同时作用，不是对某个任选析取字符串逐次替换。语法复用IX章的已内建签名，但本簇使用经典二值语义，不继承四值否定的解释。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-logic-program-syntax","status":"resolved","id":"26e8ed17356e430c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-logic-program-syntax]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-logic-program-substitution","status":"resolved","id":"ed15cbe9da0035aa","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-logic-program-substitution]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathsf{PosAt}_\\Sigma,\\mathsf{Lit}_\\Sigma,\\mathsf{Sub}_\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"l","display":false},{"tex":"C","display":false},{"tex":"\\theta\\in\\mathsf{Sub}_\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\overline A","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{FOClause}_\\Sigma:=\\{C\\subseteq\\mathsf{Lit}_\\Sigma:|C|<\\omega\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\overline{\\overline A}:=A,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{atm}(A):=A,\\qquad\\operatorname{atm}(\\overline A):=A.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{vars}_{cl}(C):=\\bigcup_{l\\in C}\\operatorname{vars}(l),\\qquad\nC\\theta:=\\{l\\theta:l\\in C\\}.","display":true}],"bytes":1651,"backlinks":[{"id":"866d47bca0b3782c","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"e6c99e2646691c7d","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"I章新增18项：[[72-df-analytic-formula-closure]] · [[72-df-atom-family-mgu]] · [[72-df-first-order-clause]] · [[72-df-first-order-clause-validity]] · [[72-df-first-order-factoring